{"id":"word:hebrew:H8504","type":"word","title":"תְּכֵלֶת","subtitle":"H8504 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the cerulean mussel , i.e. the color ( violet ) obtained therefrom or stuff dyed therewith","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תְּכֵלֶת (H8504) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 49 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תְּכֵלֶת (tᵉkêleth) means the cerulean mussel , i.e. the color ( violet ) obtained therefrom or stuff dyed therewith First listed occurrence: 2Chr 2 6."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תְּכֵלֶת","transliteration":"tᵉkêleth","pronunciation":"tek-ay'-leth","strong":"H8504","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8504","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["תְּכֵ֧לֶת","תְּכֵ֔לֶת","תְּכֵ֗לֶת","וּ/תְכֵ֧לֶת","תְּכֵ֨לֶת"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",34],["HC/Ncfsa",7],["HTd/Ncfsa",4],["HRd/Ncfsa",3],["HNcfsc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"the cerulean mussel , i.e. the color ( violet ) obtained therefrom or stuff dyed therewith","usage":"blue.","full":"H8504. tekeleth תְּכֵ֫לֶת 48 noun feminine violet , i.e. violet thread and stuff ; ᵐ5 usually υἄκινθος , υἀκίθινος ; see Thatcher Hast. DB COLOURS (Late Hebrew = Biblical Hebrew; תִּכְלָא ᵑ7 ); — 1 violet thread (spun, Exod 35:25 ; woven, 39:3 ): a. in Exodus (P) of hangings of tabernacle , ephod, etc., ׳ת + שָׁנִי תּוֺלַעַת אַרְגָּמָן, (q. v.; often also זהב שֵׁשׁ, ), Exod 25:4 ; 26:1 ; 28:5-6 , 33 ; 35:25 20 t.; of temple hangings (+ בּוּץ כַּרְמִיל, אַרְגְּוָן, אַרְגָּמָן, ) 2Chr 2:6 ; 2:13 ; 2:14 ; loops or cords of ׳ת (alone) Exod 26:4 ; 28:28 , 31 , 37 ; 36:11 ; 39:21-22 , 31 ; Num 15:38 (all P). b. palace hangings in Shushan + חוּר Est 1:6 . 2 violet stuff, fabric. ; ת ׳לְבוּשֵׁי Ezek 23:6 , וְרִקְמָה ת ׳גְּלוֺמֵי 27:24 ; ׳ת לְבוּשָׁם וְאַרְגָּמָן Jer 10:9 ; also in trade Ezek 27:7 (+ בְּרִקְמָה שֵׁשׁ אַרְגָּמָן, ), compare ת ׳בֶּגֶד for covering sacred utensils Num 4:6-7 , 9 , 11 , 12 (P).","rootNote":"probably for 7827 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 2 6","keyReferences":["2Chr 2 6","2Chr 2 13","2Chr 3 14","Esth 1 6","Esth 8 15","Exod 25 4","Exod 26 1","Exod 26 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":49,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 2 6","book":"2Chr","chapter":2,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/תְכֵ֔לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 2 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":2,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/תְּכֵ֨לֶת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 3 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":3,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּכֵ֥לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Esth 1 6","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/תְכֵ֗לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Esth 8 15","book":"Esth","chapter":8,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּכֵ֣לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 25 4","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/תְכֵ֧לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 1","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/תְכֵ֤לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 4","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּכֵ֗לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 31","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּכֵ֧לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 36","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּכֵ֧לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 27 16","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּכֵ֨לֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 5","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":5,"englishT